1
00:00:09,243 --> 00:00:10,913
(Amy:)I've never seen him
this happy before.

2
00:00:11,078 --> 00:00:14,578
It's because you've never seen him on
"Restock the Medicine Cabinet Day."

3
00:00:14,748 --> 00:00:15,918
Look!

4
00:00:16,083 --> 00:00:18,693
(Sheldon:)A new topical
antihistamine with lidocaine.

5
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:20,732
Wow!

6
00:00:20,888 --> 00:00:22,428
(Sheldon:)I can't wait until I get a rash.

7
00:00:24,157 --> 00:00:26,867
(Leonard:)Oh, Gas-X has a new ultra strength.

8
00:00:27,494 --> 00:00:29,534
(Leonard:)I guess they really do
read their mail.

9
00:00:31,098 --> 00:00:33,578
(Sheldon:)Hey, isn't that Professor Proton?

10
00:00:33,734 --> 00:00:35,074
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah.

11
00:00:39,673 --> 00:00:42,013
(Sheldon:)Look at him, just standing in line,

12
00:00:42,109 --> 00:00:45,249
(Sheldon:)like he wasn't moderately
famous 30 years ago.

13
00:00:45,746 --> 00:00:47,086
(Sheldon:)Let's go say hello.

14
00:00:47,247 --> 00:00:49,417
(Leonard:)Oh, maybe we shouldn't bother him.

15
00:00:49,583 --> 00:00:51,563
(Sheldon:)I'm not going to bother him,
I'm going to talk to him.

16
00:00:53,587 --> 00:00:55,297
(Leonard:)He thinks there's a difference.

17
00:00:55,455 --> 00:00:57,265
(Sheldon:)Arthur?

18
00:00:57,424 --> 00:00:59,704
(Sheldon:)Arthur, it's me, Sheldon Cooper.

19
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:04,020
(Sheldon:)You may not remember
because of your advanced age.

